  <p id="c-liangshu-028-peizhiping-complete:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-028-peizhiping-complete:p001:m0000" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AAB">之平</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-028-peizhiping-complete:p001:m0003" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AAB">如原</persName>，<persName id="c-liangshu-028-peizhiping-complete:p001:m0006" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AAA">之高</persName>第五弟。少亦隨<persName id="c-liangshu-028-peizhiping-complete:p001:m0015" ref="vtp_lo9_0af">邃</persName>征討，以軍功封都亭侯。歷<persName id="c-liangshu-028-peizhiping-complete:p001:m0028" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_D">武陵王</persName>常侍、扶風、弘農二郡太守，不行，除譙州長史、陽平太守。拒<persName id="c-liangshu-028-peizhiping-complete:p001:m0059" ref="5d1_8jg_amy">侯景</persName>，城陷後，遷散騎常侍、右衛將軍、太子詹事。</p>
</text>
